      "chatGptNotes": "Content and umlaut checks approved from accepted review ledger mathematik-batch-106.md (accepted_pilot). Review note: The image correctly compares three models with common start value `2`: exponential growth without upper bound, bounded growth approaching `y=20`, and logistic growth with S-shape and inflection at `y=10`. It correctly marks the carrying capacity/asymptotic boundary for the bounded and logistic models only.",
